            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "STAMPFRAN"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Easy, awesome result! I used fresh strawberries &amp; whipped cream from the can. It looked like I bought it from the store. My family ate the WHOLE pie in less than an hour.",
