            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ADACHIC"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I actually made this today. I didn't even know it was a recipe on this site (my mom gave me the directions... I'm pretty bad when it comes to \"real\" cooking. lol). It was simple to make and tastes delicious, especially on a hot day like today! This recipe was simple to make, yet awesome!! The only difference I used was I cut up fresh strawberries as opposed to the frozen ones.",
